+- Confirm the Playwright config reads `STUDENT_ID`, `RUN_TIMESTAMP`, `FEATURE`, `BROWSER`, `PLAYWRIGHT_HTML_OUTPUT_DIR`, and `PLAYWRIGHT_OUTPUT_DIR`.
